 "title": "The Beta(8, 4) posterior",
 "caption": "With a uniform Beta(1, 1) prior and 7 heads in 10 tosses the posterior is Beta(8, 4), with density 1320 x⁷(1 − x)³. It has area 1 and mean 8/12 ≈ 0.67, which az.summary reports.",
 "alt": "A single-humped curve over p from 0 to 1, peaking near 0.7 and centred near 0.67.",
